@startuml SEQ_02_MELIHAT_PRAKTIKUM
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-02: Melihat Daftar Praktikum

actor       "Admin / Asisten / Dosen / Kadep"  as User
boundary    "Browser"                          as Browser
control     "PraktikumController"              as Controller
entity      "Praktikum Model"                  as ModelP

== Lihat Daftar Praktikum ==

User    -> Browser     : Klik menu Praktikum

Browser -> Controller  : GET /praktikum

Controller -> ModelP   : Query praktikum berdasarkan kepengurusan lab
ModelP --> Controller  : Data praktikum
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman daftar praktikum
Browser --> User       : Tampil daftar praktikum

== Lihat Detail Praktikum ==

User    -> Browser     : Klik nama praktikum

Browser -> Controller  : GET /praktikum/{id}

Controller -> ModelP   : Query detail praktikum
ModelP --> Controller  : Data praktikum
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman detail praktikum
Browser --> User       : Tampil detail praktikum

@enduml